{"ref":"BDB, הֲדַס","hw":"הֲדַס","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">הֲדַס</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Isaiah 55:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.55.13\">Is 55:13</a></sup> <strong>myrtle</strong> (-tree), only late <strong>(</strong>NH, Aramaic <em>id.;</em> Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">هَدَس</span> (in the dialect of Yemen); also <span dir=\"rtl\">آسٌ</span>, Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">אָסָה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܐܳܣܳܐ</span>; cf. Löw<sup>No. 25</sup><strong>)</strong>—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ה׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 41:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.41.19\">Is 41:19</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 8:15\" href=\"/Nehemiah.8.15\">Ne 8:15</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הֲדַ֑ס</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 55:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.55.13\">Is 55:13</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַהֲדַסִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 1:8\" href=\"/Zechariah.1.8\">Zc 1:8</a> + 2 times (on form cf. Ges<sup>§ 93, R. 4</sup>)—<a data-ref=\"Isaiah 41:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.41.19\">Is 41:19</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּאַשּׁוּר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּדְהָר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּרוֹשׁ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵץ שָׁ֑מֶן</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁטָּה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶרֶז</span>); <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 55:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.55.13\">Is 55:13</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּרוֹשׁ</span>; opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַסִּרְפַּד</span>), <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲלֵי הֲדַס</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 8:15\" href=\"/Nehemiah.8.15\">Ne 8:15</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳ עֵץ עָבוֹת</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳ תְּמָרִים</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳ עֵץ־שֶׁמֶן</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲלֵי־זַיִת</span>); pl. <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 1:8\" href=\"/Zechariah.1.8\">Zc 1:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 1:10\" href=\"/Zechariah.1.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 1:11\" href=\"/Zechariah.1.11\">11</a>.","next":"BDB, הֲדַסָּה","prev":"BDB, הֲדֹם"}